      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100000\n    coupon_rate = 0.05\n    original_market_rate = 0.05\n    new_market_rate = 0.06\n    years_to_maturity = 10\n\n    annual_coupon_payment = face_value * coupon_rate\n\n    original_price = sum(\n        annual_coupon_payment / ((1 + original_market_rate) ** t)\n        for t in range(1, years_to_maturity + 1)\n    ) + face_value / ((1 + original_market_rate) ** years_to_maturity)\n\n    new_price = sum(\n        annual_coupon_payment / ((1 + new_market_rate) ** t)\n        for t in range(1, years_to_maturity + 1)\n    ) + face_value / ((1 + new_market_rate) ** years_to_maturity)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    percentage_change = ((new_price - original_price) / original_price) * 100\n    answer = round(percentage_change, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
